{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhanggu-e-o131","title":"顾徽驰诣阙乞哀原盗钱兵士","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-b04f834f4b91c649dba8","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"顾徽驰诣阙乞哀原盗钱兵士","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0036","role":"字子叹、少游学有唇吻、召署主簿、见营军将一男子至市行刑问之何罪云盗百钱、语使住、须臾驰诣阙陈启曰方今蓄养士众以图北虏视此兵丁壮健儿且所盗少愚乞哀原","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"统事闻徽有才辩、许而嘉之","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d","source_order":[52,173,7],"order":9306}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhanggu-p0036","name":"顾徽","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-e2b64ae90c6efcaedb5d","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-731a4f7dcbb9861aef8c","layer":"pei","quote":"雍母弟徽，字子叹。少游学，有唇吻。孙权统事，闻徽有才辩，召署主簿。尝近出行，见营军将一男子，至市行刑。问之：‘何罪？’云：‘盗百钱。’徽语使住。须臾，驰诣阙陈启：‘方今蓄养士众，以图北虏；视此兵丁壮健儿，且所盗少，愚乞哀原！’权许而嘉之","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a9c7df73f863da1ddae","start":7,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
